So the fauna of the Gray Fossil Site is this weird mix of familiar things,

00:30:44.712 --> 00:30:50.615
like relatively modern style snakes, like pretty modern style things like tapirs,

00:30:51.386 --> 00:30:55.628
with extinct things like saber-tooth cats and gompotheres, which are elephant relatives,

