01:16:38.284 --> 01:16:41.366
So it slows down, slows down, and then kind of levels off.

01:16:41.846 --> 01:16:46.748
And your graph is what's called a sigmoid curve, kind of s-shaped, flat mostly,

01:16:46.768 --> 01:16:49.129
and then jumps up and then goes back to being flat.

01:16:49.490 --> 01:16:56.873
And they were suggesting that the diversity of life may follow a similar trajectory,

01:16:57.425 --> 01:17:03.328
