01:17:15.173 --> 01:17:20.575
until you fill every possible place that you can and then slowing back down again,

01:17:21.246 --> 01:17:24.747
the Cambrian explosion might just be the middle part.

01:17:25.428 --> 01:17:29.429
Then their argument was basically saying, maybe this isn't special.

