Because we didn't watch the first half of the show because we don't have those fossils.

01:27:06.733 --> 01:27:11.515
This is one of those suggestions that is, it's definitely a valid point, right?

01:27:11.525 --> 01:27:19.049
Like you have, like I said, the earliest period of diversification is always difficult to

01:27:19.109 --> 01:27:20.469
