01:27:31.975 --> 01:27:35.596
There's a lot of diversification and a lot of animals showing up.

01:27:36.104 --> 01:27:39.906
So there's this question of, was it an explosion?

01:27:39.926 --> 01:27:41.747
Was it a slow explosion?

