You hear a lot of people call it the Cambrian radiation instead of explosion.

01:27:46.930 --> 01:27:51.813
And that's one of the things that I like to make a point with that question here is, it's

01:27:51.853 --> 01:27:54.194
not so much that we're saying it wasn't anything special.

