You know, the Cambrian is just a place and number we put on it.

01:28:19.744 --> 01:28:25.106
So, well, when it was first discovered way back in the day, it looked like it was all

01:28:25.126 --> 01:28:32.170
of a sudden, whereas today we understand that, well, okay, still fast, but all of a sudden

